OL,3,CWatchdog launches probe into UK
OL,4,Ccharities working in illegal Israeli
OL,5,Csettlements
OL,7,FAn inquiry into charities working in
OL,8,Fillegal Israeli settlements in
OL,9,FPalestine has been launched by the
OL,10,FUK's charity watchdog, after "serious
OL,11,Fallegations" were made.
OL,13,FThe Charity Commission's probe will
OL,14,Flook into eight charities, examining
OL,15,Fhow funds were used in settlements,
OL,16,Fthe purpose of that spending and
OL,17,Fwhether it was to further charitable
OL,18,Fpurposes.
OL,26,@rD@^OUsD@LO]
