FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785917894
OL,3,CWatchdog launches probe into UK
OL,4,Ccharities working in illegal Israeli
OL,5,Csettlements
OL,7,FThough the current investigation
OL,8,Finvolves eight charities, the watchdog
OL,9,F` which regulates charities based in
OL,10,FEngland and Wales ` said it plans to
OL,11,Finvestigate more that "appear to
OL,12,Fexpend charitable funds to support
OL,13,Factivities and/or projects within
OL,14,Fillegal Israeli settlements in
OL,15,FPalestine".
OL,26,@sD@WOUwD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785917894
OL,3,CWatchdog launches probe into UK
OL,4,Ccharities working in illegal Israeli
OL,5,Csettlements
OL,7,FThe commission said the inquiry is a
OL,8,Ffact-finding exercise and, because
OL,9,Fthere is no prior evidence of
OL,10,Fwrongdoing, the watchdog has decided
OL,11,Fnot to name the charities it is
OL,12,Finvestigating.
OL,14,FIt also cited potential risks to the
OL,15,Fsafety and security of individuals,
OL,16,Fbut added that it will consider naming
OL,17,Fthe organisations when it publishes
OL,18,Fits report at a later date.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785917894
OL,3,CWatchdog launches probe into UK
OL,4,Ccharities working in illegal Israeli
OL,5,Csettlements
OL,7,FThe investigation will also allow the
OL,8,Fwatchdog, which does not investigate
OL,9,Fcriminal allegations, to assess
OL,10,Fwhether charity assets or
OL,11,Fbeneficiaries are at risk and if any
OL,12,Fregulatory action is needed.
OL,14,F"All charities must be able to
OL,15,Fdemonstrate that they are delivering
OL,16,Fon their charitable purposes, wherever
OL,17,Fin the world they operate and whatever
OL,18,Fthey do," said Stephen Roake,
OL,19,Fassistant director of high risk
OL,20,Fcompliance at the Charity Commission.
OL,26,@vD@AOUzD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
