OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785917894
OL,3,CWatchdog launches probe into UK
OL,4,Ccharities working in illegal Israeli
OL,5,Csettlements
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,F"Serious allegations have been made
OL,13,Fabout UK charities operating in
OL,14,Fillegal Israeli settlements in
OL,15,FPalestine, so our first step is to
OL,16,Festablish the facts.
OL,18,F"Only then can we determine if
OL,19,Fregulatory action is required, based
OL,20,Fon our findings and the evidence we
OL,21,Fsee.
OL,26,@tD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
