OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785917894
OL,3,CWatchdog launches probe into UK
OL,4,Ccharities working in illegal Israeli
OL,5,Csettlements
OL,7,F"Our fact-finding will also help us
OL,8,Fdevelop regulatory guidance for
OL,9,Fcharities, which will to help ensure
OL,10,Fpublic trust and confidence in
OL,11,Fcharities."
OL,13,FThe regulator said it has informed
OL,14,Fpolice and HMRC about the scope of its
OL,15,Finquiry, which may be extended if any
OL,16,Fother regulatory issues arise during
OL,17,Fthe investigation.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@KO]
